## Summary
Park Su-hong publicly apologized for his 'immature judgment' regarding a controversy involving flight delays. The incident has garnered media attention and led to his apology statement.

## Key Points
- Park Su-hong issued a public apology
- The apology addressed his immature judgment
- The controversy centered around a flight delay incident
- The matter has been reported in media outlets


